    "detailed_description": "<strong>**This Game is in BETA - Download the free iOS or Android app if you want to test out gameplay before purchasing!**<br>*During Early Access, please leave ALL FEEDBACK in Discord so we can improve this project together.*</strong><br><br>Brawl Hopper, a new 3d, online multiplayer, procedural arena brawler - is the big brother to the beloved Cloud Hopper game.<br><br>Battle between up to 8 players per procedurally generated level. New level generated each day! Multiplayer is cross-platform between Windows, OSX, Android, iOS &amp; tvOS.<br><br>Brawl Hopper v0.1 was originally created in a collective 24 hours, though is part of a Devlog series and will continue to get monthly releases led by our community feedback.<br><br>Over the course of Early Access there will be more levels, characters, weapons, powerups, music, Steam achievements, etc. to come.",
